:: OC Lea Arcade Shooter [nobr]

/* Intro */
You spy a familiar face dominating the gunslinger game at the end of the walkway. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Dominating!”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">The machine echoes your thoughts as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lea</span> , <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Birdy</span> ’s twin sister, aims like a deadeye without missing a single shot.</span> A few people glance over as they walk by, trying not to look too invested. You hear some whisper, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Is that a girl?”</span> or <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“She’s pretty good, but”</span> as they try to rationalize their own skill against who they’d normally see as <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“just a girl”</span>. But you know better than to underestimate <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lea</span>  and walk over with a smirk, praising her gameplay. <br>

